#~ msgid ""
#~ "typing;trainer;touch typing;keyboard;speed;wpm;words per "
#~ "minute;accuracy;test;"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "tipkanje;trener;vaditelj;vadnica;tipkanje na "
#~ "dotik;tipkovnica;hitrost;wpm;bnm;besede na minuto;besed na "
#~ "minuto;natančnost;preizkus;"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There is no doubt that typing on a keyboard is an essential skill in the "
#~ "digital age. Typing fast and accurately gives you more opportunities, "
#~ "more time for what matters to you, and a sense of self-accomplishment."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Nobenega dvoma ni, da je tipkanje bistvena veščina v digitalni dobi. "
#~ "Hitro in natančno tipkanje vam daje več priložnosti, več časa za tisto, "
#~ "kar vam je pomembno, in občutek samouresničitve."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Keypunch lets you practice typing. Thanks to fast-paced sessions with "
#~ "instant feedback afterwards and a plethora of available languages, you "
#~ "might even have a little fun doing so. With determination, proper "
#~ "technique and some time, you will observe a noticeable increase in both "
#~ "the speed and the accuracy of which your thoughts and ideas are put into "
#~ "words on the screen."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Tipkarica vam omogoča vadbo tipkanja. Zahvaljujoč hitrim sejam s "
#~ "takojšnjimi povratnimi informacijami in številnim razpoložljivim jezikom "
#~ "se boste morda celo malo zabavali. Z odločnostjo, pravilno tehniko in "
#~ "nekaj časa boste opazili opazno povečanje hitrosti in natančnosti, ko se "
#~ "vaše misli in ideje izražajo v besedah na zaslonu."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you are already a racer at typing, Keypunch still has something for "
#~ "you. Try practicing with numbers and punctuation, or choose your own text "
#~ "to type out as fast as you can."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Če ste že hitrih prstov pri tipkanju, ima Tipkarica še vedno nekaj za "
#~ "vas. Poskusite vaditi s številkami in ločili ali pa izberite svoje "
#~ "besedilo, ki ga boste natipkali čim hitreje."

#~ msgid "Get ready to accelerate your typing!"
#~ msgstr "Pripravite se na pospešitev tipkanja!"

#~ msgid ""
